      "name": "lowercasedUrn",
      "default": null,
      "doc": "System-computed. The entity's own URN with the name lowercased in full, including any platform\ninstance prefix; the platform and environment are unchanged. Indexed as an exact-match keyword,\nso a reference in any casing resolves to the entity's real URN in one batchable lookup.",
